        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-404, 3\" Leaf and Berry Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Leaves and Berries Cabinet Pull is the perfect statement detail for all sorts of applications, be it in the kitchen, the bathroom, or on an end table in the living room. The design is subtle, giving this 3 inch pull a natural feel that is perfect for adding a bit of whimsy to your home. The CP 404 Cabinet Pull is available in 6 finishes, each of which adds real beauty to the piece. Trust us when we say that the pictures do not do this pull justice.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/leaf-and-berry-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-204\"<b>CK-204 Leaf and Berry Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-404 Leaves and Berries Wavy Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<l>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
